{"id":"f2852b232e05523a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates.md","title":"Typed Predicate Registry","display":"df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates — Typed Predicate Registry","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates","aliases":["58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates"],"display":"df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates — Typed Predicate Registry","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates — Typed Predicate Registry"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P^{\\mathrm{tg}}_{58}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal P^{\\mathrm{tg}}_{58}\\in V\\)</span> is a set of syntactic predicate-signature codes.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner P/n\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner P/n\\urcorner\\)</span> denotes the code of predicate name <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> with arity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The registered symbols are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Manifold}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stratification}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Stratification}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}repair\\text{-}topological\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}predicates}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P^{\\mathrm{tg}}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\ulcorner\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Connected}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S/2\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Homeo}_S/5\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Embedding}_S/5\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Manifold}_S/3\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S/7\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S/8\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S/3\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Stratification}_S/4\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S/4\\urcorner\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}repair\\text{-}topological\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}predicates}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P^{\\mathrm{tg}}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\ulcorner\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Connected}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S/2\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Homeo}_S/5\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Embedding}_S/5\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Manifold}_S/3\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S/7\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S/8\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S/3\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Stratification}_S/4\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S/4\\urcorner\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a metasyntactic registry of names and arities, not a set of mathematical predicates treated as ordinary ZFC elements.</li>\n<li>The former registry mixed undefined predicates with theorem names such as Riemann–Roch and Riemann–Hurwitz; those have been removed from the predicate registry.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P^{\\mathrm{tg}}_{58}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner P/n\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Connected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Manifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stratification}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}repair\\text{-}topological\\text{-}geometric\\text{-}predicates}\\vdash\n\\mathcal P^{\\mathrm{tg}}_{58}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\ulcorner\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Connected}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{PathConnected}_S/2\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Disconnected}_S/2\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Homeo}_S/5\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Embedding}_S/5\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Manifold}_S/3\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S/7\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{AttachingSphere}_S/8\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{CurveGenus}_S/3\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Stratification}_S/4\\urcorner,\n\\ulcorner\\mathrm{WhitneyStratification}_S/4\\urcorner\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1953,"backlinks":[{"id":"95424dd12dde8d34","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1080","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates.md|58-df-repair-topological-geometric-predicates]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":[]}